IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ea-voting`

-- Electoral Act 1907 (WA), ss 17, 17AA, 18, 155AB and 156 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_electoral-act-1907.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

