§ `s 156(1), (1A), (16), (16A) -- the duty and the offence`

#ASSERT `must vote` `Chloe` 21 `did not vote`
#ASSERT NOT `must vote` `Chloe` 21 `was interstate on polling day`
#ASSERT NOT `must vote` `Chloe` 21 `was in hospital on the voting days`
#ASSERT NOT `must vote` `Chloe` 17 `did not vote`
#ASSERT `must vote` `Jake in 2029` 22 `did not vote`
#ASSERT `must vote` `a prisoner serving 2 years` 30 `did not vote`

#ASSERT `commits the offence of failing to vote` `Jake in 2029` 22 `did not vote`
#ASSERT NOT `commits the offence of failing to vote` `Jake in 2029` 22 `abstained as a religious duty`
#ASSERT NOT `commits the offence of failing to vote` `Jake in 2029` 22 `was interstate on polling day`

#ASSERT `the fine for failing to vote` EQUALS 200

#ASSERT `the fine for a false response` EQUALS 1000

